[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3642379485","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113894#issuecomment-3642379485","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113894","id":3642379485,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ZGkzd","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-11T15:09:32Z","updated_at":"2025-12-11T15:10:13Z","body":"It highlights the whole column with all he buttons, it's not as clear but the highlight is clearly visible in the video, and it works the same as the other columns\n\n<img width=\"348\" height=\"107\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/468b3cef-e837-469a-a130-4a53e54436c9\" />\n\nThe column highlight helps navigation too, making it clear what column you're actively engaging with, so I'd say the solution here would be to either make the buttons highlight differently, or increase the margins to make the highlight more visible","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3642379485/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3655017804","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113894#issuecomment-3655017804","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113894","id":3655017804,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Z2yVM","user":{"login":"OlegVegan","id":9021673,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMjE2NzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9021673?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegVegan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-15T10:58:45Z","updated_at":"2025-12-15T10:58:45Z","body":"My issue is that this tiny highlight is useless, it doesn't help seeing what you're deleting\nIn a table view (in any other software) it highlights the whole row, so that you know what you're working with\n\nMy suggestion is this:\n<img width=\"1192\" height=\"340\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cbeeec9f-0875-4b47-830c-35d17e814094\" />\n\nNow you can actually tell what singleton you're about to delete\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3655017804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3655057670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113894#issuecomment-3655057670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113894","id":3655057670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Z28EG","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-15T11:09:32Z","updated_at":"2025-12-15T11:09:32Z","body":"I agree that it's not very usable, but the highlight is there, it's just blocked, it's important to have the issue clear so that it can be fixed correctly, so saying that the highlight isn't there is not correct and might confuse anyone trying to fix this\n\nI don't know about other software in particular but in this case each column matters to be able to access what you are focusing on, that's an accessibility aspect and we use that in the editor to make it easier to use, making the entire line highlighted when each column can be interacted with would be a reduction in accessibility and usability\n\nI'd say that the fix is instead to make sure the highlight remains clear, by fixing the issue of the background of the icons blocking the highlight (this might have been reported already but can't remember now will search later), and probably also make the individual icon highlight clearer by using a different highlight to make it clear which specific button is hovered, as well as the whole icon section\n\nAdditionally I'd suggest adding a outline highlight to the whole line to make it clear which line *and* which column is focused, while not reducing the specific highlights","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3655057670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5197444317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113894#issuecomment-5197444317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113894","id":5197444317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNcq03Q","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptio